# Normalise line endings in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Biome formats to LF, so a Windows checkout left at the platform default
# materialises CRLF and the working tree is then permanently "unformatted"
# against its own committed content: `bun run lint` fails on files that are
# byte-identical to HEAD. `eol=lf` keeps the checkout matching the stored blob on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

